+
+## Creating JSON Patches
+
+`createPatch(from, to)` produces an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+that changes `from` into `to`. It emits granular operations for nested object members and array edits,
+and does not mutate either input.
+
+```ts
+import { createPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+const patch = createPatch(
+  { profile: { name: "Ada", role: "developer" } },
+  { profile: { name: "Ada", role: "maintainer" } },
+);
+// [{ op: "replace", path: "/profile/role", value: "maintainer" }]
+```
