+title: "Create JSON Patch"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement and export `createPatch(from, to)` so callers can send an RFC 6902 patch that transforms
+one JSON document into another without mutating either input. The generated patch must describe
+localized changes rather than replacing an entire document for a small nested change. Add coverage
+for correctness, escaping, no-op inputs, invalid JSON values, and input preservation.
